      "title": "Mythical Miniature Retrieval",
      "description": "Retrieve a stolen miniature of Mount Hymettus with supernatural properties from a private collector's secured villa in Voula. The miniature, created by a genius artist living in Ilioupoli, induces hallucinations tied to Ancient Greek mythology and tragedies, causing physical harm to those affected. Infiltrate the villa, bypass its advanced security, and recover the miniature. Return it to the artist's house near Mount Hymettus in Ilioupoli, where he plans to store it in a secure and undisclosed location to prevent future theft."
